==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Remember to keep a beefy [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]] off cooldown for when the Zang Roo spawns so your base doesn't get destroyed while you're charging down the lane, thinking you've got it handled. Zang Roo has an Area Attack with 8,000 damage every second, so be careful. Shadow Boxer K only spawns when the enemy base is hit, so she is not too much to worry about.

The Ursamajor is the least of your worries but still a threat, especially if you don't have many [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from Ch. 2 & 3 when attempting this stage. [[:Category:Cats with Freeze ability|Cats with Freeze abilities]] are a huge help in saving some of your frontliners from Zang Roo.

